<!-- ===================== BIO + FACT PANEL ===================== -->
<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">About</p>
  <h1 class="display">{{ site.name }}</h1>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight wrap" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">Max Murphy is a product strategist, architect, and builder who turns ambitious ideas into shipped products &mdash; from MVP to enterprise scale.</p>

      <p>He is Principal Strategy Consultant at <strong><a href="https://modea.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Modea</a></strong>, where he built the strategy practice from the ground up and now leads both it and the consulting arm of the firm&rsquo;s software agency.</p>

      <p>He is also the founder of <strong><a href="https://sinsa.ai" rel="noopener" target="_blank">SINSA</a></strong>, an AI consulting company built around a simple position: AI is an operational standard now, not a forecast, and the work that matters is what reaches production. SINSA covers AI strategy and roadmapping, rapid prototyping, custom model fine-tuning and RAG, and application development, supported by its own research division.</p>

      <p>Before Modea he was Director of Product Management &amp; Strategy for the US market at <strong>SourceFuse</strong>, directing a portfolio of six product managers and more than $6M in annual delivery, and leading internal AI product innovation &mdash; a user story generator, infrastructure-as-code scaffolding, and automated code review.</p>

      <p>Over more than twelve years he has shipped products across fintech, enterprise SaaS, marketplaces, and early-stage ventures. At <strong>PayPal</strong> he led the Enterprise Content Management platform, quadrupling content velocity and lifting conversion 40% across nine global markets. As second product hire at <strong>Relief Financial</strong> he scoped and shipped the MVP and raised ML prediction accuracy 35% for debt and credit risk. At <strong>Dominion Enterprises</strong> he delivered Homes.com to more than ten million monthly users and launched the AutoTrader vehicle listing ads platform, driving $25M+ in annual revenue.</p>

      <p>Alongside all of it, he has been building the web for over twenty years &mdash; starting with customizing MySpace pages in HTML and CSS, and turning into more than 150 websites as a freelance developer. That work has run parallel to every job he has held, and it is where most of the product instincts came from.</p>

      <p>He works across the full arc of product development &mdash; research, strategy, prototyping, design, and code &mdash; and takes on a small number of strategic engagements each year.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="factbar">
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Based in</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">{{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Role</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">
          {%- set currentRoles = [] -%}
          {%- for job in profile.experience -%}
            {%- if not job.endDate -%}{%- set currentRoles = (currentRoles.push(job), currentRoles) -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- for job in currentRoles %}{{ job.title }}, {{ job.org }}{{ " · " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Works on</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">{{ profile.knowsAbout | join(", ") }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Previously</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">PayPal · Relief Financial · People Rocket · Cognizant · Dominion Enterprises · Marathon Consulting</div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Also</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">Freelance web developer &mdash; 150+ sites over 20+ years</div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Updated</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">{{ build.time | readableDate }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="factbar__row">
        <div class="factbar__label">Verify</div>
        <div class="factbar__value">
          <a href="/who-is-max-murphy/">Disambiguation</a> &middot;
          <a href="/resume.json">resume.json</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

